    rdf:value """Monday, Sept. 30, 1907
Scirocco. Rain.
Scott, Miss Alexander.
Maud went.
Scott and I had tea at Villa Doccia and saw a marvellous sunset. Coming home it was very cold, and I got a chill.
Bernhard came down to Milan with Mansourov. Guido met him at Gallarate in the motor and brought him to Gazzada. """^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 295 ;
